OL,3,AHundreds missing, including 291 foreign
OL,4,Atourists, after deadly flash flood on
OL,5,ANepal-Tibet border
OL,6,
OL,7,FAt least 31 people have been killed,
OL,8,Fand hundreds of tourists are missing,
OL,9,Fafter a massive flash flood and
OL,10,Fmudslide on the Nepal-Tibet border
OL,12,FThe missing tourists include more than
OL,13,F100 from India and 12 from the UK,
OL,14,Faccording to Nepal's tourist board
OL,16,FCCTV from Tibet shows a wall of water
OL,17,Fand mud hitting buildings at a border
OL,18,Fcrossing - other images from Nepal show
OL,19,Fpeople trying to flee as the flood
OL,20,Fsurges
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
